From: GeForce-Now-Kiosk
Subject: [PATCH] WebCore/loader/DocumentLoader: include EventLoop.h explicitly

DocumentLoader.cpp calls eventLoop().queueTask(...). In the unified source
build EventLoop stays a forward declaration and the build fails. Include
EventLoop.h directly.

--- a/Source/WebCore/loader/DocumentLoader.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebCore/loader/DocumentLoader.cpp
@@ -52,6 +52,7 @@
 #include "DocumentWindow.h"
 #include "DocumentWriter.h"
 #include "ElementChildIteratorInlines.h"
+#include "EventLoop.h"
 #include "Event.h"
 #include "EventNames.h"
 #include "ExtensionStyleSheets.h"
